        {
          "id": "t2-m2",
          "senderId": "me",
          "content": "Yeah, I'd pull it into a hook:\n```ts\nfunction useDebounced<T>(value: T, ms = 300) {\n  const [v, setV] = useState(value)\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const id = setTimeout(() => setV(value), ms)\n    return () => clearTimeout(id)\n  }, [value, ms])\n  return v\n}\n```",
          "time": "Mon",
          "status": "read"
        },
